# Human-approval markers — local-only evidence of approval, NEVER in git
# (Phase 13 Chunk A1 lesson: the prior `feature/m1-domain` branch accidentally
# committed them via `git add .`. The hooks read them from disk; the repo
# must not carry them.)
.human-approvals/*.txt

